  "description": "Fitomad.DeepSeek is a .NET library that allows you to access the powerful AI models from DeepSeek, such as deepseek-chat or deepseek-, through a simple and intuitive interface. You can use Fitomad.DeepSeek to generate text or code with just a few lines of code. Fitomad.DeepSeek provides various options to customize your requests and responses. Whether you want to create a chatbot, a content generator, a sentiment analyzer, a translator, or any other AI-powered application, Fitomad.DeepSeek can help you achieve your goals with ease and efficiency.",
